1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:13,460
How was the drunk removed from the ring?
醉汉是怎么被弄出斗牛场的？

2
00:00:13,460 --> 00:00:17,270
How was the drunk removed from the ring?
醉汉是怎么被弄出斗牛场的？

3
00:00:19,690 --> 00:00:25,480
During a bullfight, a drunk suddenly wandered into the middle of the ring.
在一次斗牛时，一个醉汉突然溜达到斗牛场中央。

4
00:00:26,540 --> 00:00:28,490
The crowd began to shout,
人群开始喊叫，

5
00:00:29,250 --> 00:00:32,200
but the drunk was unaware of the danger.
但醉汉没有意识到危险。

6
00:00:33,610 --> 00:00:36,960
The bull was busy with the matador at the time,
当时公牛正对付斗牛士，

7
00:00:36,980 --> 00:00:44,990
but it suddenly caught sight of the drunk who was shouting rude remarks and waving a red cap.
但它突然看见了那个正说着粗话、挥舞红帽子的醉汉。

8
00:00:46,720 --> 00:00:49,490
Apparently sensitive to criticism,
公牛显然对批评很敏感，

9
00:00:50,040 --> 00:00:55,250
the bull forgot all about the matador and charged at the drunk.
它把斗牛士忘得一干二净，朝醉汉冲了过去。

10
00:00:56,720 --> 00:00:59,450
The crowd suddenly grew quiet.
人群突然安静下来。

11
00:01:00,480 --> 00:01:04,030
The drunk, however, seemed quite sure of himself.
然而醉汉似乎很有把握。

12
00:01:05,170 --> 00:01:07,440
When the bull got close to him,
当公牛逼近他时，

13
00:01:07,840 --> 00:01:11,390
he clumsily stepped aside to let it pass.
他笨拙地闪到一边让公牛过去。

14
00:01:12,680 --> 00:01:17,770
The crowd broke into cheers and the drunk bowed.
人群爆发出欢呼声，醉汉鞠了一躬。

15
00:01:18,840 --> 00:01:26,630
By this time, however three men had come into the ring and they quickly dragged the drunk to safety.
不过这时已有三个人走进斗牛场，迅速把醉汉拖到了安全的地方。

16
00:01:27,650 --> 00:01:30,780
Even the bull seemed to feel sorry for him,
连公牛似乎也为他感到遗憾，

17
00:01:31,120 --> 00:01:40,570
for it looked on sympathetically until the drunk was out of the way before once more turning its attention to the matador.
因为它同情地看着，直到醉汉被带走，才重新把注意力转向斗牛士。
